  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "からだを　つつみこむ　いとだまはてんてきの　ストライクの　カマをはねかえす　！\u0003\u0007弾力性だんりょくせい弾力性を　もつ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "몸을 감싸고 있는 실타래는 천적인 스라크의 낫을 튕겨 낼 정도의 탄력을 자랑한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "包裹著身體的線球擁有足以把天敵飛天螳螂的鐮刀反彈回去的彈力。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La boule de fil qui entoure son corps est assez élastique pour repousser les faux d’Insécateur, son ennemi juré.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Fadenkugel, die seinen Körper umgibt, ist sehr elastisch. Selbst die Sicheln seines natürlichen Feindes Sichlor prallen an ihr ab.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La bola de hilo que le rodea el cuerpo es lo bastante elástica como para repeler las guadañas de los Scyther, su enemigo natural.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il gomitolo che avvolge il suo corpo è talmente elastico da far rimbalzare le falci di Scyther, suo predatore naturale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The ball of threads wrapped around its body is elastic enough to deflect the scythes of Scyther, this Pokémon’s natural enemy.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体を　包みこむ　糸玉は天敵の　ストライクの　カマをはね返す　！\u0003\u0007弾力性だんりょくせい弾力性を　持つ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "包裹着身体的丝线团具有十足的弹力，能把天敌飞天螳螂的镰刀反弹回去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La bola de hilo que le rodea el cuerpo es lo bastante elástica como para repeler las guadañas de los Scyther, su enemigo natural.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おしりから　だす　いとはワイヤーに　ひってきする　きょうど。つよさの　ひみつが　けんきゅうされているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "엉덩이에서 나오는 실은 와이어에 필적하는 강도를 자랑하며 그 비밀에 대해서는 현재 연구 중이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "從臀部射出的絲線，強度足以與金屬絲匹敵。強度的秘密仍在研究中。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son postérieur sécrète un fil aussi résistant qu’un câble en fer. Cette solidité inexpliquée fait actuellement l’objet de recherches.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Faden, den Tarundel über seinen Hinterleib absondert, ist so stark wie Draht. Das Geheimnis dieser Stärke wird noch erforscht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El hilo que secreta por la parte trasera es fuerte como el alambre. Su resistencia es un misterio que a día de hoy aún se sigue estudiando.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il filo che espelle dal didietro è resistente quanto un cavo metallico. Il segreto della sua robustezza è tuttora oggetto di studi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The thread it secretes from its rear is as strong as wire. The secret behind the thread’s strength is the topic of ongoing research.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "お尻から　出す　糸はワイヤーに　匹敵する　強度。強さの　秘密が　研究されているのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "从臀部射出的丝线的强度可以匹敌金属丝。强度的秘密至今仍在被研究中。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
